Two formerly active paths are retained so old links do not silently load stale missions:

- [`erdos_problem_99_1.7.10_FINAL_CONTINUATION_PROMPT.md`](erdos_problem_99_1.7.10_FINAL_CONTINUATION_PROMPT.md)
  now redirects to the current Target A prompt. Its original content is preserved under
  `historical/`.
- [`erdos_problem_99_TARGET_C_1.0_FINAL_CONTINUATION_PROMPT.md`](erdos_problem_99_TARGET_C_1.0_FINAL_CONTINUATION_PROMPT.md)
  now redirects to the current Target C prompt. Its original content is preserved under
